{"url":"https://www.saudia.com/en-SA/before-flying/travel-information/hajj-and-umrah/tourist-visa","status":200,"title":"Saudi Arabia Visa Requirements & Application Guide | Saudia","desc":"Learn about Saudi Arabia visa requirements, application steps, and travel rules. Apply easily and plan your trip today with Saudia.","finalUrl":"https://www.saudia.com/en-SA/explore/visit-saudi-arabia/visas","bodyClass":"baseLang withTravelNotice mWebHomePage light-theme","h":4464,"sig":[{"tag":"app-jss-columns","comps":["app-jss-image-link-list"],"h":460,"headings":1,"imgs":1,"text":57},{"tag":"app-jss-columns","comps":["app-jss-title-text"],"h":304,"headings":0,"imgs":0,"text":1039},{"tag":"app-jss-columns","comps":["app-jss-faq"],"h":771,"headings":1,"imgs":0,"text":4183},{"tag":"app-jss-columns","comps":["app-jss-title-text"],"h":200,"headings":1,"imgs":0,"text":939},{"tag":"app-jss-columns","comps":["app-jss-image-link-list"],"h":120,"headings":0,"imgs":0,"text":0},{"tag":"app-jss-columns","comps":["app-jss-title-text"],"h":206,"headings":0,"imgs":0,"text":174},{"tag":"app-jss-columns","comps":["app-jss-faq"],"h":883,"headings":1,"imgs":0,"text":1474}],"h1":["Saudi Arabia Visa Requirements & Application Guide | Saudia","Saudi Arabia Tourist, Transit & Stopover Visa Information"],"html":"<sc-placeholder _ngcontent-saudiawebapp-c260489156=\"\" name=\"jss-main\"><!----><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container-fluid\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-image-link-list class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"custom-carousel imagelinklist--content-embedded h--left v--top image--slider md--adjustment ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div appswiper=\"\" fxflex=\"auto\" class=\"swiper-container ng-star-inserted swiper-initialized swiper-horizontal swiper-backface-hidden\"><div class=\"swiper-wrapper\"><div class=\"swiper-slide ng-star-inserted swiper-slide-active\"><div fxlayout=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"\" fxflexfill=\"\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"swiper-slide__image desktop-view ng-star-inserted\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" alt=\"Tourists enjoying traditional Saudi hospitality and local culture in a lively outdoor market surrounded by people in traditional attire.\" width=\"1920\" height=\"600\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Live-images/pages/visas/visas-desktop.ashx?h=600&amp;iar=0&amp;w=1920&amp;rev=a9e31efd91a6438f80140e43c2856cca&amp;hash=04D2592167DA235FC080F86B11AA1339\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"image-gradient\" id=\"8173d8f5-2f21-4694-990e-8e99d8b2a42e\"></div></div><!----><!----><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"swiper-slide__content\"><!----><!----><h1 appexcerpttext=\"\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Saudi Arabia Tourist, Transit &amp; Stopover Visa Information</span><!----></h1><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><div class=\"custom-pagination ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"container\"><div id=\"cpage_banner\" class=\"custom-pages\"></div></div></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></app-jss-image-link-list><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-title-text class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"title-text isCashMilesInView ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><!----><p appexcerpttext=\"\" class=\"titleTextSub ng-star-inserted\">\n\n<div class=\"visa-section\">\n  <div class=\"visa-text\">\n    <p>Saudi Arabia is welcoming the world with its newly introduced stopover transit visa, to experience the Kingdom’s renowned hospitality, rich heritage, vibrant culture, and extraordinary landscapes from stunning coastlines and majestic deserts to dynamic cities and ancient wonders.</p><br>\n    <p>The stopover transit visa is a one-year, multiple-entry visa that allows visitors to stay in the Kingdom for up to 90 days, offering the flexibility to explore more of Saudi Arabia at their own pace.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"visa-video\">\n    <iframe src=\"https://www.facebook.com/plugins/video.php?href=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2FVisitSaudi%2Fvideos%2F488662081957415%2F&amp;width=400&amp;show_text=false&amp;height=224&amp;appId\" allowtransparency=\"true\" allow=\"encrypted-media\" allowfullscreen=\"true\">\n    </iframe>\n  </div>\n</div></p><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></app-jss-title-text><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-faq class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"faq-section ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"container\"><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.lt-lg=\"column\" fxlayoutgap=\"20px grid\" fxlayoutgap.gt-lg=\"24px grid\"><div fxflex.gt-lg=\"50\" class=\"faq__title\"><h2 class=\"primary-heading ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"\">Saudi Arabia Visa Information</h2><!----><!----></div><div fxflex.gt-lg=\"50\"><mat-accordion class=\"mat-accordion faq__accordion\"><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-0 mat-expanded mat-expansion-panel-spacing ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-1 ng-tns-c1859850774-0 ng-animate-disabled mat-expanded mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"Stopover Transit eVisa\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-0\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-0\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-1\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-1\"> Stopover Transit eVisa </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-1 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-0 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-0\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-0\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-0\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\">\n\n<p>In collaboration with the Ministry of Foreign Affairs (MOFA), Saudia now offers you the opportunity to easily obtain a Stopover Transit eVisa. This eVisa is valid for 90 days and allows you to stay in Saudi Arabia for up to 96 hours.</p>\n\n<p>Steps to get your Free Stopover Transit eVisa:</p>\n\n<ol class=\"ol-layout1\">\n  <li>Available to citizens and residents of 60+ countries, or to travelers holding a valid tourist visa for the GCC countries, the UK, the USA, or the Schengen area.</li>\n  <li>Select Transit eVisa under Seats and Extras and complete the required information for the selected passengers.</li>\n  <li>Once your visa eligibility is confirmed and the insurance fee is paid, you will receive your Stopover Transit eVisa instantly.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<div class=\"cta-container\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.saudia.com/transit-visa\" class=\"cta-button\" target=\"_blank\">Book Stopover Flight</a>\n</div>\n\n<br class=\"t-last-br\"></p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-2 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-3 ng-tns-c1859850774-2 ng-animate-disabled mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"Tourist eVisa\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-1\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-3\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-3\"> Tourist eVisa </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-3 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-2 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-1\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-1\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-2\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\">\n\n\n<p>Saudi Arabia is welcoming travelers from 60+ eligible countries through its fast and convenient online stopover transit visa. Visitors can discover the Kingdom’s renowned hospitality, rich heritage, vibrant culture, and diverse landscapes from the mountains of Abha to the shores of the Red Sea and the dunes of the Empty Quarter.</p>\n\n<p>The one-year, multiple-entry visa allows tourists to stay in Saudi Arabia for up to 90 days for leisure, events, family visits, and Umrah (excluding Hajj and other activities such as studying).</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"cta-container\">\n  <a href=\"https://visa.visitsaudi.com/Registration/Verify\" class=\"cta-button\" target=\"_blank\">Apply for Stopover Transit Visa</a>\n</div>\n\n<br class=\"t-last-br\"></p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-4 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-5 ng-tns-c1859850774-4 ng-animate-disabled mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"Visa On Arrival\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-2\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-2\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-5\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-5\"> Visa On Arrival </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-5 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-4 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-2\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-2\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-4\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\">\n\n<p>Tourist can apply for stopover transit visa on Arrival* at one of Saudi Arabia's entry points for citizens and residents of 60+ countries where eligibility conditions are met.</p>\n \n<div class=\"cta-container\">\n  <a href=\"https://visa.visitsaudi.com/\" class=\"cta-button\" target=\"_blank\">Eligible Countries List</a>\n</div>\n\n<br class=\"t-last-br\"></p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-6 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-7 ng-tns-c1859850774-6 ng-animate-disabled mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"Consulate Visa\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-3\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-3\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-7\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-7\"> Consulate Visa </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-7 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-6 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-3\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-3\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-6\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\">\n\n<p>Tourists that are not from eligible countries list should apply for a consulate visa through Saudi embassies and consulates. </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"cta-container\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.mofa.gov.sa/\" class=\"cta-button\" target=\"_blank\">Locate Nearest Embassy</a>\n</div>\n\n<br class=\"t-last-br\"></p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><!----></mat-accordion></div></div></div></div><!----></app-jss-faq><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-title-text class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"title-text isCashMilesInView ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><!----><p appexcerpttext=\"\" class=\"titleTextSub ng-star-inserted\">\n<h2 class=\"p-adjust\">Packages</h2>\n<p>Saudia Umrah offers a range of thoughtfully curated Umrah packages designed to provide a seamless and comfortable spiritual journey, including:\n</p>\n<ul class=\"ul-sh-package\">\n    <li>Direct flights from London, Manchester, and Birmingham.</li>\n    <li>Financial protection through ATOL and ABTA schemes.</li>\n    <li>Premium onboard hospitality and a selection of quality accommodation options.</li>\n    <li>Affordable multi-city tours and flexible travel packages.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Citizens and permanent residents of the United Kingdom can conveniently apply for the Saudi tourist eVisa online before traveling to Saudi Arabia.</p>\n<p class=\"p-adjust-bottom\">Don’t forget to use promo code <strong><span class=\"saudiagreen-text\">PACKAGE5 </span></strong>at checkout to enjoy additional savings on your booking.</p></p><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></app-jss-title-text><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-image-link-list class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"imagelinklist imagelinklist--content-right imagelinklist--horizontal h--left v--top ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><ul><!----></ul><!----></div></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></app-jss-image-link-list><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-title-text class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"title-text isCashMilesInView ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><!----><p appexcerpttext=\"\" class=\"titleTextSub ng-star-inserted\"><p>For official information and guidance related to Hajj and Umrah, please visit the following links:</p>\n<ul>\n    <li><a href=\"https://www.haj.gov.sa/Haj\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Hajj</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://www.haj.gov.sa/Umrah\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Umrah</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://www.moh.gov.sa/en/HealthAwareness/Pilgrims-Health/Pages/default.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Hajj &amp; Umrah health requirements</a></li>\n    <li><a href=\"https://learn.haj.gov.sa/landing/index-en.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Hajj &amp; Umrah awareness platform</a></li>\n</ul></p><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></app-jss-title-text><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-faq class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"faq-section ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"container\"><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.lt-lg=\"column\" fxlayoutgap=\"20px grid\" fxlayoutgap.gt-lg=\"24px grid\"><div fxflex.gt-lg=\"50\" class=\"faq__title\"><h2 class=\"primary-heading ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2><!----><!----></div><div fxflex.gt-lg=\"50\"><mat-accordion class=\"mat-accordion faq__accordion\"><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-8 mat-expanded mat-expansion-panel-spacing ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-9 ng-tns-c1859850774-8 ng-animate-disabled mat-expanded mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"Do I need a visa to visit Saudi Arabia?\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-4\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-4\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-9\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-9\"> Do I need a visa to visit Saudi Arabia? </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-9 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-8 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-4\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-4\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-8\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><p>Most travelers require a valid visa before entering Saudi Arabia. The type of visa depends on your nationality and purpose of travel.</p></p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-10 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-11 ng-tns-c1859850774-10 ng-animate-disabled mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"What is a Saudi Arabia stopover transit visa?\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-5\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-5\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-11\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-11\"> What is a Saudi Arabia stopover transit visa? </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-11 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-10 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-5\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-5\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-10\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><p>A stopover transit visa allows eligible travelers to enter Saudi Arabia during a transit journey and explore the country for a limited period.</p></p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-12 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-13 ng-tns-c1859850774-12 ng-animate-disabled mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"Can I apply for a Saudi Arabia tourist visa online?\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-6\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-6\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-13\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-13\"> Can I apply for a Saudi Arabia tourist visa online? </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-13 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-12 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-6\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-6\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-12\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><p>Yes. Eligible travelers can apply for a Saudi tourist eVisa online before traveling to Saudi Arabia.</p></p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-14 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-15 ng-tns-c1859850774-14 ng-animate-disabled mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"Who is eligible for a Saudi Arabia visa on arrival?\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-7\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-7\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-15\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-15\"> Who is eligible for a Saudi Arabia visa on arrival? </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-15 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-14 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-7\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-7\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-14\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><p>Visa-on-arrival eligibility depends on nationality and current Saudi entry requirements. Travelers should verify eligibility before departure.</p></p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-16 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-17 ng-tns-c1859850774-16 ng-animate-disabled mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"How long is a Saudi Arabia stopover visa valid?\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-8\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-8\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-17\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-17\"> How long is a Saudi Arabia stopover visa valid? </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-17 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-16 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-8\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-8\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-16\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><p>The stopover transit visa is generally valid for one year and may allow multiple entries, subject to current regulations.</p></p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-18 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-19 ng-tns-c1859850774-18 ng-animate-disabled mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"Can I perform Umrah with a Saudi Arabia tourist visa?\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-9\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-9\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-19\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-19\"> Can I perform Umrah with a Saudi Arabia tourist visa? </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-19 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-18 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-9\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-9\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-18\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><p>In many cases, eligible visitors can perform Umrah using a valid tourist visa, subject to current Saudi regulations and permit requirements.</p></p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-20 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-21 ng-tns-c1859850774-20 ng-animate-disabled mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"How long does it take to get a Saudi Arabia eVisa?\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-10\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-10\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-21\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-21\"> How long does it take to get a Saudi Arabia eVisa? </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-21 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-20 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-10\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-10\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-20\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><p>Processing times vary, but many eVisa applications are approved quickly after submission of the required information.</p></p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-22 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-23 ng-tns-c1859850774-22 ng-animate-disabled mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"What documents are required for a Saudi Arabia visa application?\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-11\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-11\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-23\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-23\"> What documents are required for a Saudi Arabia visa application? </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-23 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-22 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-11\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-11\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-22\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><p>Requirements vary by visa type but may include a valid passport, travel details, accommodation information, and supporting documentation.</p></p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><!----></mat-accordion></div></div></div></div><!----></app-jss-faq><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><!----></sc-placeholder>"}